e the corresponding letter grade according to the provided table.\\n  - Return a list of letter grades in the same order as the input GPAs.\\n- **Edge Cases**:\\n  - If the input list is empty, return an empty list.\\n  - Ensure the GPA values are within the valid range (0.0 to 4.0). If any GPA is outside this range, consider it invalid and handle it appropriately (e.g., raise an error or assign a default grade)."}'}]
