 (0.0 to 4.0), raise an error or assign a default grade (e.g., \'Invalid\').\\n   - Use a series of if-elif statements to determine the corresponding letter grade based on the GPA-to-letter grade mapping provided.\\n   - Append the determined letter grade to `letter_grades`.\\n4. Return the `letter_grades` list.\\n\\nEdge Cases:\\n- Handle empty input list by returning an empty list.\\n- Validate GPA values to ensure they are within the range [0.0, 4.0]. If not, handle with an error or a default grade.\\n\\nComplexity:\\n- Time Complexity: O(n), where n is the number of GPAs in the input list.\\n- Space Complexity: O(n), for storing the resulting letter grades."}'}]
